[[New watermark in the menu's own style: separate cells for FPS, ping and the time; FPS and ping turn yellow or red when they get bad]],[[Choose what the watermark shows: Watermark FPS, Watermark Ping, Watermark Clock (Visuals > Overlays)]]
,[[New Keybind List: real rows with a dot and a key cap, a header that counts what is on, and it grows to fit long names]],[[Only Active Keybinds: the list only shows the features that are on]]}},{'v5.23.5',{
[[The loader now always gets the newest version straight after a release (it could give the previous one for a few minutes)]]}},{'v5.23.4',{
[[ESP preview: no longer zoomed in - it zooms out until your whole avatar fits (hair, crowns, tails), with the box around the body like in the game]],'ESP preview: a label you drag follows the pointer again'}},{'v5.23.3',{
[[ESP preview: the box now fits your avatar the way it does in the game (hats, wings and floating effects no longer shrink the avatar)]],[[ESP preview: the skeleton follows your avatar's own body instead of a fixed stick figure]],
[[ESP preview: labels on the left or right are no longer cut off - the box makes room for them]]}},{'v5.23.2',{[[More clean-up: changing animation packs no longer leaves old animations loaded]],
[[Browsing the emote Library for a long time no longer keeps growing memory]],[[Turning X-Ray or Performance Mode off, and turning the Loud Sound Limiter on, no longer hitch on big maps]],
[[Invisible recovers by itself if it fails in a game (the toggle used to stay stuck)]]}},{'v5.23.1',{[[Big clean-up for long sessions: less memory used over time and less work every frame]],
[[ESP is lighter in full servers (skeleton, boxes and labels only update what changed)]],[[X-Ray, Remove Invisible Walls and Performance Mode always put the map back, and no longer freeze big maps when switched]],
[[Emotes keep working after hundreds of plays in one life; My Emotes and the Library are smoother with big collections]],[[Fixed: Chat Spam or the Jerk Tool could keep running after turning them off or reloading]],
[[Fixed: Anti-Void could get stuck putting you back every frame on low maps]],[[Fixed: turning Invisible off right after on could lose your character]],
[[Fixed: failed rejoins / server hops made the menu start several times in the next server]],[[Fixed: the profile card now says when someone isn't your friend; chams no longer stay on far-away NPCs]]}},{'v5.23',{
[[Walk to a saved spot: a Walk button next to Go in Saved Teleports (finds its way around walls; WASD stops it)]],[[World: sky presets, Exposure, Ambient Light, Remove Shadows and a Personal Light only you can see]],
[[World: Click to Delete Parts on your screen, with Undo and Restore]],[[Camera: Camera Through Walls, force first or third person, Freecam to Target]],[[Rejoin Where You Stood, and Fly / Noclip now carry the vehicle you're sitting in]],
[[Loud Sound Limiter, mute one player's sounds, Low FPS / Ping Alerts and Streamer Mode]],[[Fixed: Fullbright and Clear Weather Effects stopped with an error in games with an Atmosphere]]}},{'v5.22',{
[[Radar (Visuals): a small map of the players around you that turns with your camera; friends in green, names optional]],
[[Crosshair (Visuals): cross, T-shape or dot with your own colour, length, gap, thickness, outline, centre dot and spin]],[[Active Features List: everything that's on, shown in the top-right corner while you play]],
[[Radar and the list can be dragged anywhere and remember their spot]]}},{'v5.21',{[[New Follow Player (Players tab): walks after the selected player, finds a way around walls and stops a few studs away]],
[[Follow Distance slider (3-15 studs); walk yourself with WASD at any time, click another player to switch]],'The old teleporting Auto Follow in Trolling is gone'}},{'v5.20.3',{
[[The Understanding logo now shows next to the name (on executors that support custom images)]]}},{'v5.20.2',{[[ESP labels above a player sit a little higher, clear of their head]],
[[Labels in the ESP preview sit right next to the box on every side]]}},{'v5.20.1',{'ESP preview lines up with the menu (same top and height)','Dragging a label in the preview now stays under your cursor',
[[Dropdowns, colour pickers and the notification log open exactly next to their button]]}},{'v5.20',{[[New player ESP: box (full or corners), name, distance, held item, health bar and number, skeleton, head dot]],
[[Tracers from the bottom, middle, top or your mouse; arrows for players off screen; NPC ESP]],[[Visible Check colours players by whether a wall is in the way; text background and size]],
[[ESP preview next to the menu on the Visuals tab, on your own avatar: drag a label to move it]]}},{'v5.19',{[[New compact layout: sections sit side by side in two columns, each a card with its title inside]],
[[Checkboxes instead of switches; colour swatches and keybinds sit on the feature's own row]],[[Slimmer sliders, dropdowns and text boxes, and a wider window]]}},{'v5.18',{
[[Object ESP (Visuals): see doors, chests, shops, dropped tools or anything by name through walls]],[[Air Walk (Myself): walk on an invisible floor in mid-air; jump to go up, hold Ctrl to go down]],
[[Chat Log (Players): scroll back, search and copy public chat; optional alert when someone says your name]],[[Music player (Home): play sounds only you hear, with 8 tracks from Roblox's library and a saved list]],
[[Fixed: Tracers can be turned on without another ESP being on]]}},{'v5.17',{[[Full remake: rounded floating panels, line icons in the sidebar and header]],[[Drag the window from any empty space, and scale it from any corner]],
[[New notifications: icon, timer bar, hover to pause, click to dismiss]],'Smoother motion (switch off in Appearance \u{2192} Reduce Motion)'}},{'v5.16',{[[New look: cleaner, darker design with each section grouped into one card]],
[[Sidebar without emoji, grouped into Player, Style, World and Menu]],[[Slimmer switches and sliders, key caps for keybinds, quieter title bar and active bar]]}},{'v5.15.1',{
[[Dragging the bottom-right corner now scales the whole menu (same as Menu Scale), and it's remembered]],[[Removed the feature counts on the tabs and the red dots (the tooltip warning stays)]]}},{'v5.15',{
[[Click a section title to fold it; options that don't apply yet stay hidden until they do]],[[Bar along the bottom shows what's on (click to turn off), and each tab shows how many]],
[[Tab icons, a Compact Sidebar option, and drag the bottom-right corner to resize the window]],[[Colour pickers for chams, name ESP and tracers; dropdowns for notification corner and emote sort]],
[[Notification history (bell in the title bar), Background Blur, red dot on risky features]]}},{'v5.14',{[[New Animations tab: 18 Roblox animation packs; right-click a pack to mix and match parts]],
